  "releaseNotes": "### All packages\n* Shortened package namespaces and package IDs\n\n### Main package\n* Updated to DotPrimitives 4.1.0 from 4.0.0\n* Added ``Version`` methods ``Max`` and ``Min`` C#14 static extension methods.\n* Deprecated ``Version`` methods ``GetNewerVersion`` and ``GetOlderVersion`` for removal in v10 - Use the newly added ``Max`` and ``Min`` C#14 static extension methods instead.\n* Added ``Directory`` static C# extension methods for Safe File Enumeration and Safe Directory Enumeration",
